# CODEOWNERS (Round 3 / W7, ADR-H288).
#
# The harness is the part of this repository where a mistake is hardest to
# see: a tool that quietly stops being reachable, a policy that stops
# narrowing, a size that grows back. These paths get a second pair of eyes.
#
# NOTE: ownership is expressed as a ROLE (`@BlackEclipse/maintainers`), never as a
# personal account. The team resolves once the project has an org or a GitHub
# team; until then GitHub shows it as unresolved, which is honest - the path is
# assigned, the group does not exist yet. A personal handle was deliberately NOT
# used here: this repository is public, and a maintainer's account should not be
# baked into the source tree just to satisfy a review request.

/Black-Eclipse-site/python/harness/            @BlackEclipse/maintainers
